{
  "transcriptVersion": 1,
  "id": "devicecode-denied",
  "description": "A device-code flow the person refuses (I-37). beginSignIn() posts the device id alone; one poll is pending. The player confirms the code, signs in at the (mocked) IdP and presses Deny on the approval page, server-side and unrecorded. The next poll answers the generic error (the same shape as a provider failure, so the poller learns nothing about the cause), which the client reports as an error with the sign-in-denied code, holding no token. The flow stays denied on the next poll.",
